@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

!include _retriever-classes.iuml

main ..> Settings : builds
main ..> webapp : create_app
main ..> ConversationEngine : answers once\n(without --serve)

webapp ..> Settings
webapp ..> EngineProvider : creates
webapp ..> ConversationLocks : creates
webapp ..> SlidingWindowRateLimiter : creates
webapp ..> InMemoryConversationStore : creates
webapp ..> ChatRequest : validates
webapp ..> ChatResponse : returns
webapp ..> ConversationResponse : returns
webapp ..> NewConversationResponse : returns
webapp ..> ErrorResponse : returns

SlidingWindowRateLimiter ..> RateLimitDecision : returns

EngineProvider o-- ConversationEngine : shares one instance
EngineProvider o-- ConversationStore
EngineProvider ..> Settings

pipeline ..> ConversationEngine : creates
pipeline ..> AnswerResult : returns

ConversationEngine --> Settings
ConversationEngine --> ConversationStore
ConversationEngine ..> AnswerResult : returns

InMemoryConversationStore ..|> ConversationStore

note bottom of ConversationEngine
  The collection, the embedding model and both
  Bedrock clients are created once per engine.
  See classes-retriever-retrieval.puml
  for the stages the engine orchestrates.
end note

remove @unlinked
@enduml
